# Run in order on a fresh server. Restart to reset capacity and booking IDs.

### 1. Missing fields: 422, two required violations, no lookup
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2. Invalid values: 422, two positive violations, no lookup
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"activityId": -1, "seats": 0}

### 3. Unknown activity: 422, not_found, one lookup
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"activityId": 999, "seats": 2}

### 4. Not enough seats: 422, insufficient_seats, one lookup
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"activityId": 1, "seats": 5}

### 5. Create booking: 201, booking ID 1, one lookup; reserves two seats
POST http://localhost:8080/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"activityId": 1, "seats": 2}
